    <statement><p>Calculate the 3x3 determinant:</p>
<p><m>\left| \begin{array}{ccc}
-6 \amp  2 \amp  -6 \\
4 \amp  -5 \amp  0 \\
5 \amp  0 \amp  4  \end{array} \right| =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-62</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>\left| \begin{array}{ccc}
-6 \amp  2 \amp  -6 \\
4 \amp  -5 \amp  0 \\
5 \amp  0 \amp  4  \end{array} \right| = -6 \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 -5 \amp  0 \\
 0 \amp  4  \end{array} \right| - 2  \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 4 \amp  0 \\
 5 \amp  4  \end{array} \right|  - 6  \left| \begin{array}{ccc}
 4 \amp  -5 \\
 5 \amp  0  \end{array} \right| =</m>



<m>= -6(-5\cdot 4-0\cdot 0)-2(4\cdot 4-0\cdot 5) - 6(4\cdot 0 + 5\cdot 5)=-62</m>






</solution>
